            "ta, {n}. same to you.", "likewise, {n}!", "you as well, {n}. stay out of trouble.", "cheers {n}, and yourself!",
            "back at you, {n}.", "thanks {n}. don't die out there.", "same to you, {n}. see you about.", "and to you, {n}!"
